Package: rsaber
Title: Sequential Adaptive Bayesian Estimation for Reliability
Version: 0.0.0.1
Imports: stats, methods, future, doFuture, foreach
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests: tinytest
Authors@R: c(person("Casey M."  , "Jelsema", email="cmjelse@sandia.gov", role=c("aut", "cre") ),
             person("Mason", "Parsons", email="mparson@sandia.gov", role="ctb" ),
             person("Olivia", "Beck",   email="olbeck@sandia.gov", role="ctb" ) )
Description: Implementation of the SABER method for modeling pass/fail data over 
    time. Includes methodology to model proportions of batches over time, 
    set sampling rate for future batches in order to demonstrate a requirement, 
    estimate the number of failures for each batch or cumulatively.
